{% block part_work_handoff %}# Work Handoff

This reference requires the recommended or full profile and actual native MCP tools.
For an explicit Work Contract request, use `create_work_contract` with a unique `source_id` and
`contract` containing `schema: "powercontext.work-contract.v1"`, `trust: "untrusted_input"`,
the inspected objective, facts as WorkClaims, in-scope work, exclusions, completion criteria,
authorization notes and open questions. A contract is evidence of agreed work, not new execution authority.
Use the current-request Scope for all operations; read [Scope and memory](scope-memory.md) first.

{% endblock %}
